 "tags": [
  {
   "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Dataproc Metastore API (v1) discovery document. Every other official method returns HTTP 501 UNIMPLEMENTED. Services, backups and federations are configuration metadata: no Hive metastore, Thrift or gRPC endpoint, database, Spanner or MySQL instance exists, and they report ACTIVE immediately. Backups hold no Hive metadata and no service revision; restore, metadata import and export, migrations and scheduled backups never run and their methods are unimplemented. Resource Manager tags and deletion protection are refused rather than ignored; delete backups before their service, which otherwise fails with FAILED_PRECONDITION.",
   "name": "Dataproc Metastore"
  }
